{"id":"aca515b20bf2fbd3","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-tarski-undefinability.md","title":"Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","display":"thm-tarski-undefinability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-tarski-undefinability","aliases":["92-thm-tarski-undefinability"],"display":"thm-tarski-undefinability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-truth-predicate]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"],"source":"第 II 章 pp. 24–26（PDF 41–43）","source_status":"原书语义 Tarski 定理的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-tarski-undefinability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-tarski-undefinability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tarski-undefinability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b82bf7f23ed43df1\" href=\"?note=b82bf7f23ed43df1\" title=\"92-df-truth-predicate\">92-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 24–26（PDF 41–43）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书语义 Tarski 定理的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (candidate truth formula and distinguished variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G\\)</span> (full truth-definition predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b82bf7f23ed43df1\" href=\"?note=b82bf7f23ed43df1\" title=\"92-df-truth-predicate\">92-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)\\)</span>已在<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b82bf7f23ed43df1\" href=\"?note=b82bf7f23ed43df1\" title=\"92-df-truth-predicate\">92-df-truth-predicate</a>中用无捕获代入和外部算术真理精确定义，避免把公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>误写成可直接应用于数码的元层函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> : 句子</li>\n<li>Tarski定理是关于标准算术真在标准模型中的不可定义性，不以某个证明系统的相容性为定义</li>\n<li>通过Liar悖论构造：若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>定义真，对角构造给出与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},x)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},x)\\)</span>同真值的句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>，从而导致矛盾</li>\n<li>与Gödel不完备性定理密切相关</li>\n<li>结论针对完整算术真理；固定复杂度层的部分真谓词仍可在算术中定义</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这是标准模型语义版本，不以 Con(G) 为前提。若借用 G 的内部固定点，再转标准真值，需用标准自然数满足本地 PA 公理的事实；原书第二章直接作语义对角构造。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 pp. 24–26（PDF 41–43）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"b82bf7f23ed43df1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f3fdd55235f4984e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"b82bf7f23ed43df1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G$ (full truth-definition predicate, see [[92-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"b82bf7f23ed43df1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)$已在[[92-df-truth-predicate]]中用无捕获代入和外部算术真理精确定义，避免把公式$T$误写成可直接应用于数码的元层函数","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruthDef}_G(T,x)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(T,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false}],"bytes":1838,"backlinks":[{"id":"f2940633bae35b52","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"证明采用 [[92-thm-tarski-undefinability]] 的标准模型版本：若码集 c.e.，其枚举程序的“某个有限阶段输出 n”可写成存在一个有限计算记录的算术条件；存在量化得到 Σ₁ 的 n 成员公式。这是本文 CE 计算模型所用的标准算术正常形事实，见 [[92-df-ce-set]] 的背景约定。对所有句码，它便定义完整标准真值，与 Tarski 冲突。此证明不把只适用于固定 G 定理集合的 [[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable]] 擅自实例化为真算术。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-326","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-tarski-undefinability]]"}],"outgoing":["b82bf7f23ed43df1","5a1bd470754681a7","d666a3e3ee6c8148","f3fdd55235f4984e"]}